                <ApiTable Kind="ApiKind.Properties" Title="MaskResult" Rows="Vocab.MaskResult" />
                <p><code>MaskPattern</code> does the checking: <code>new MaskPattern(mask).Apply(input, prompt, includeLiterals)</code> returns a <code>MaskResult</code>, so a server can check a value with the same rules. The error text appears under the box with the class <code>fx-field-error</code> inside the <code>fx-masked-textbox</code> wrapper.</p>
            </DocSection>
